# Ansible Homelab Inventory
# ===========================
# Organized by infrastructure category for easier management
# Last updated: June 2026
#
# Quick reference:
#   - Add new machines in their category section
#   - Use hostnames when available, IPs for temporary/new hosts
#   - Uncomment/comment hosts to enable/disable them
#   - See GETTING_STARTED.md for how to use this file

