# ============================================================================
# QUICK REFERENCE - Common Operations
# ============================================================================
# Update all Linux:
#   ansible-playbook playbooks/linux_apt-upgrade.yml -i inventory -kK
#
# Ping all machines:
#   ansible -i inventory all -m ping
#
# Bootstrap new machine:
#   1. Add to [setup] group
#   2. ansible-playbook playbooks/bootstrap.yml -i inventory -kK --limit "hostname"
#   3. Move to appropriate group
#
# See GETTING_STARTED.md for more help!
